function about(){return info('About AURIX',`<p><strong>AURIX — Imagine. Create. Build.</strong> is an independent creative workspace for images, coding help and writing. It is currently an early-stage site hosted on Firebase Hosting for staging, with a separate Blogger theme available.</p><h2>What works today</h2><p>Signed-in requests pass through the AURIX Cloudflare Worker, which calls Cloudflare Workers AI for images and Pollinations.ai for text. Video generation is not active. ${window.AurixCloud?'Google sign-in is required to use the interactive studio; explicit cloud saves are available.':'User accounts and cloud sync are not active.'} There are no ads at launch.</p><h2>How we build trust</h2><p>We do not simulate model responses, fake quota balances or show pretend generation progress. Free provider availability can change. Always check the results before use, especially code and factual writing.</p><h2>Brand</h2><p>The AURIX skull artwork is based on the project owner’s supplied reference image. AURIX is not affiliated with Pollinations.ai.</p>`)}
